cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use CATELib, please cite this software and the original papers for the
  methods you use.
type: software
license: MIT
title: "CATELib: A Library for Personalised Causal Effect Estimation"
authors:
  - family-names: Chauhan
    given-names: Vinod Kumar
abstract: >-
  A Python library for conditional average treatment effect estimation with
  multiple simultaneous interventions, readable estimator interfaces and
  optional experiment, tuning and saved-result reporting tools.
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - conditional average treatment effects
  - simultaneous interventions
  - heterogeneous treatment effects
repository-code: "https://github.com/jmdvinodjmd/CATELib"
